---
import SlideShell from '@talks/shared/components/SlideShell.astro';
---
<div class="slide">
  <SlideShell number="12" total="19" label="Capa 4" />
  <h2 class="title">ACP — <em>Agent Communication Protocol</em></h2>

  <p class="body" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px;">
    El idioma común entre agentes. Permite que sistemas de <strong>distintos proveedores se hablen</strong>.
  </p>

  <div class="acp-diagram">
    <div class="acp-agent" style="border-color:rgba(0,232,122,0.35);">
      <div style="font-size:1.4rem;">🦀</div>
      <div class="acp-name">OpenClaw Agent</div>
      <div class="acp-vendor">Anthropic</div>
    </div>

    <div class="acp-channel">
      <div class="acp-line"></div>
      <div class="acp-proto">
        <span style="color:var(--cyan);">ACP</span>
      </div>
      <div class="acp-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="acp-agent" style="border-color:rgba(0,212,255,0.35);">
      <div style="font-size:1.4rem;">⚡</div>
      <div class="acp-name">Hermes Agent</div>
      <div class="acp-vendor">Google / OpenAI</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-col" style="margin-top:20px;gap:16px;">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Interoperabilidad</h3>
      <p>Un agente de Anthropic puede delegar tareas a un agente de OpenAI. <strong>Sin código intermedio.</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Estándar abierto</h3>
      <p>IBM, Cisco, Salesforce, Anthropic — todos adoptaron ACP. <strong>Es el HTTP de los agentes.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="acp-msg">
    <span class="acp-from">openclaw-agent</span>
    <span class="acp-arrow"> → </span>
    <span class="acp-to">hermes-agent</span>
    <span class="acp-content"> : "Necesito que analices este dataset y me pases el resultado"</span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
/* ══ SLIDE 12 — ACP ══ */
.acp-diagram {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0;
  margin: 8px auto 0;
}
.acp-agent {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  background: rgba(15,35,24,0.7);
  border: 2px solid rgba(0,232,122,0.15);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 16px 24px;
  min-width: 140px;
  text-align: center;
}
.acp-name { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.acp-vendor { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }

.acp-channel {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0 8px;
  gap: 0;
}
.acp-line {
  width: 40px;
  height: 2px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,212,255,0.2), rgba(0,212,255,0.5));
}
.acp-proto {
  background: rgba(0,212,255,0.08);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.35);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-m);
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}

.acp-msg {
  margin-top: 16px;
  background: rgba(5,16,12,0.9);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.15);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 10px 18px;
  font-family: var(--font-m);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  max-width: 720px;
}
.acp-from { color: var(--green); }
.acp-arrow { color: var(--muted); }
.acp-to { color: var(--cyan); }
.acp-content { color: var(--muted); }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .acp-diagram { flex-direction: column; }
  .acp-channel { flex-direction: column; padding: 8px 0; }
  .acp-line { width: 2px; height: 22px; }
  .acp-agent { width: 100%; max-width: 280px; }
  .acp-msg { font-size: 0.68rem; padding: 10px 14px; }
}
</style>
